      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent: Learning Rate and Batch Size on a Loss Bowl\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings, x and z. It is steeper along x than along z. A red ball starts on the slope and takes up to 40 steps. Each step moves it by the learning rate times a noisy mini-batch estimate of the slope. An orange arrow shows the next mini-batch step. A grey arrow shows the step the full data would give. An orange trail marks the path, and a dark ghost trail can keep the previous run. Readouts give the loss, the step count, the step length and the run status.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlBlue\",\"color\":\"#8aa4c8\"},{\"id\":\"ballRed\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"pathOrange\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"keptBlue\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"slopeGrey\",\"color\":\"#5a5f66\"},{\"id\":\"markDark\",\"color\":\"#333a44\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlGrid\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.64,2.31,2.01,1.73,1.49,1.28,1.1,0.95,0.83,0.74,0.67,0.64,0.64,0.67,0.74,0.83,0.95,1.1,1.28,1.49,1.73,2.01,2.31,2.64],[2.53,2.2,1.9,1.63,1.39,1.17,0.99,0.84,0.72,0.63,0.57,0.54,0.54,0.57,0.63,0.72,0.84,0.99,1.17,1.39,1.63,1.9,2.2,2.53],[2.44,2.1,1.8,1.53,1.29,1.08,0.89,0.74,0.62,0.53,0.47,0.44,0.44,0.47,0.53,0.62,0.74,0.89,1.08,1.29,1.53,1.8,2.1,2.44],[2.35,2.02,1.72,1.44,1.2,0.99,0.81,0.66,0.54,0.45,0.38,0.35,0.35,0.38,0.45,0.54,0.66,0.81,0.99,1.2,1.44,1.72,2.02,2.35],[2.27,1.94,1.64,1.37,1.12,0.91,0.73,0.58,0.46,0.37,0.31,0.28,0.28,0.31,0.37,0.46,0.58,0.73,0.91,1.12,1.37,1.64,1.94,2.27],[2.2,1.87,1.57,1.3,1.06,0.84,0.66,0.51,0.39,0.3,0.24,0.21,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.39,0.51,0.66,0.84,1.06,1.3,1.57,1.87,2.2],[2.15,1.81,1.51,1.24,1,0.79,0.6,0.45,0.33,0.24,0.18,0.15,0.15,0.18,0.24,0.33,0.45,0.6,0.79,1,1.24,1.51,1.81